
### Computed/Calculated Properties

var radius = 10 

var diameter: Int {    // Computer Properties
2 * radius
}
print(diameter)

radius = 20 

print(diameter)

 Text: this is to display any static text
 ImageView: to show any image
 TextField: take the text input from user
 Button:  user interactive element
 List: display the list of items
 Grid: to display the grid UI
 ScrollView: For horizontal and Vertical scroll
 Stepper
 Slider


### Arrange UI

 VSStack: Vertical arrange element
 HStack: Horizontal arrange element
 ZStack:  stack items on top of eachother
 NavigationStack: To navigate from one view to another view


